# Scratch is throwaway (one-off probe scripts), with one exception: the captured
# API responses screenshot-test.mjs replays as fixtures. It reads three of these
# at module scope, so without them the suite can't even start on a fresh clone.
# Listed individually rather than un-ignoring *.json, so a stray scratch file
# doesn't get committed by accident.
scratch/*
!scratch/journey_test.json
!scratch/sev_test.json
!scratch/sev_test_no_bus.json
!scratch/motis_journey_test.json
!scratch/motis_reverse_geocode_test.json
screenshots/
screenshot-test-output/

